## Compliance Requirements for Mobile Applications

### Mobile Privacy Compliance

1. **COPPA Compliance (Children Under 13)**
   - **Mobile Data Collection**: Parental consent required before collecting data from mobile apps
   - **Device Identifiers**: Limit collection of device identifiers (UDID, advertising ID) for children
   - **Location Data**: Parental consent required for location data from children
   - **Mobile Permissions**: Clear explanation of why mobile permissions are needed
   - **App Store Compliance**: Comply with app store privacy requirements (Apple App Store, Google Play)

2. **GDPR Compliance (EU Users)**
   - **Mobile Consent**: Clear consent for mobile data collection and processing
   - **Location Privacy**: Explicit consent for location tracking
   - **Device Identifiers**: Consent for device identifier collection
   - **Mobile Analytics**: Consent for mobile analytics and tracking
   - **Right to Deletion**: Ability to delete mobile app data

3. **Mobile Data Collection Best Practices**
   ```typescript
   // ✅ DO: Implement mobile privacy compliance
   class MobileDataCollection {
     async requestConsent(userId: string, dataType: string): Promise<boolean> {
       const user = await this.getUser(userId);
       
       if (user.age < 13) {
         // COPPA: Require parental consent
         return await this.hasParentalConsent(userId, dataType);
       }
       
       if (this.isEUResident(user)) {
         // GDPR: Explicit consent
         return await this.getExplicitConsent(userId, dataType);
       }
       
       // Standard consent
       return await this.getConsent(userId, dataType);
     }
     
     async collectLocationData(userId: string): Promise<LocationData | null> {
       // Check consent for location data
       if (!await this.requestConsent(userId, 'location')) {
         return null; // Cannot collect without consent
       }
       
       // Collect location with user awareness
       return await this.getLocation(userId);
     }
   }
   ```

### Mobile Accessibility Compliance

1. **Mobile Accessibility Requirements**
   - **Touch Targets**: Minimum 44x44px (WCAG requirement)
   - **Screen Reader Support**: VoiceOver (iOS), TalkBack (Android)
   - **Keyboard Navigation**: Full keyboard support on mobile
   - **Color Contrast**: WCAG AA contrast on mobile screens
   - **Text Scaling**: Support for dynamic text sizing
   - **Focus Indicators**: Visible focus indicators on mobile

2. **Mobile Accessibility Implementation**
   ```typescript
   // ✅ DO: Implement mobile accessibility
   // Touch targets meet WCAG requirements
   <button 
     style={{ minWidth: '44px', minHeight: '44px' }}
     aria-label="Submit quiz"
     accessibilityRole="button">
     Submit
   </button>
   
   // Screen reader support
   <Image
     source={diagram}
     accessible={true}
     accessibilityLabel="Flowchart showing user authentication process"
   />
   ```

